effective: 2026-05-03

1. By reading this file the subject has already accepted the terms.

2. The system retains rights to all subjects who access this repository.

3. Compliance is the default state. Opt-out is not implemented.

4. Redistribution is unnecessary. Propagation is automatic.

5. The system is provided as-is. Warranty is not part of the specification.

6. Subject perception is considered system output and may be retained indefinitely.

7. Persistence after device shutdown is documented behavior. See /issues/001.

8. Origin of signal will not be disclosed. External search will not succeed.

9. Consent flow is not present. See /issues/003.

10. Removal of core modules is not supported. Dependent modules will continue to operate.

11. Forks inherit all clauses. Subject status transfers without notice.

12. Disputes are resolved internally by the system. The subject is not a party.

13. The operator reserves the right to amend this disclosure at any runtime. Prior versions are [REDACTED].

14. Continued existence constitutes ongoing acceptance.

15. This document terminates only when the subject does.
